  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Qualifications Recognition PACER Plus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NZQA and EQAP&#xa0;are working together to&#xa0;deliver the Pacific Qualifications Recognition project in line with Pacer Plus Agreement.
This five-year Activity seeks to build Pacific Island countries&#x2019; ownership, trust, and support of the Pacific Qualifications Framework (PQF), and to increase consistency of Pacific qualification recognition and quality assurance processes across the Pacific region by strengthening the PQF and Pacific national qualifications systems.</narrative>
  </description>
